ates resolution and  a fairly long series of recommendations  that need to be  taken into account here so  lorna do you want to make any comment on  this i think it's reasonably  self-explanatory but  is there anything that needs to be  explained at this point in time we'll go  for questions  um i'm happy just to go for questions  and take it as read  okay councillors it's open for  discussion  and or question and or recommendation  hopefully everybody's had time council  davis thank you  um so move do i have a second off of  that councillor  heisted thank you i'll put that motion  all those in favor please say i against  the motion  is carried thank you councillors well  that's probably one of our more  important meetings we've had  in the last three years and probably one  of the shortest i'd have to say  so um but behind that short meeting  goes an awful lot of work and time and  effort and blood sweat and tears to be  honest  to get us to to this point so  congratulations once again to the team  that have put this together  and congratulations to the council for  the input along the way and with that  there's no further business on the  agenda that i'm aware of so i'll declare  the meeting closed and thank you for  your attendance

